---
description: CETECH Delivery Engine release and environment safety
alwaysApply: true
---
A source checkout passing tests does not prove a release ZIP.
For release work, build from a clean committed SHA, verify the extracted package, and record source SHA, bytes and SHA-256.
Never move an accepted historical tag or overwrite an artifact under the same version.
Do not mutate production/FLAIROC/training without explicit human authorization.
Record remote WooCommerce/WordPress side effects; Git rollback does not undo them.
